# Production deploy with every change

When making user-facing or content changes to this site (UI, data, copy, images, sections):

1. Implement the change.
2. **In the same turn**, commit, push to `origin/master`, and deploy with `npx vercel --prod --yes`.
3. Reply with the production URL: https://okinawa-family-trip-eight.vercel.app

Do not wait for the user to say「本番反映して」or「URLにも反映して」.

Exceptions: pure questions, exploration with no edits, or when the user explicitly says not to deploy.
